{"game":"Grandia","source":"custom","apworld":"grandia.apworld","world_version":"0.15.0","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"include_gold_chests","name":"Include Gold Chests","kind":"toggle","doc":"Include gold chest / gold bag pickups as Archipelago locations and items.\n\nWhen disabled, those pickups stay vanilla (you receive the gold in-game),\nthey are omitted from the location pool, and Gold filler items are not\nplaced in other chests.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Inclure la poitrine en or / sacs en or comme emplacements et articles d'archipel.\n\nLorsque handicapés, ces pick-up restent vanille (vous recevez l'or en jeu), ils sont omis de la piscine d'emplacement, et Gold articles de remplissage ne sont pas placés dans d'autres poitrines."},{"key":"include_soldiers_graveyard","name":"Include Soldier's Graveyard","kind":"toggle","doc":"Include Soldier's Graveyard chest pickups as Archipelago locations.\n\nWhen disabled, that optional dungeon keeps vanilla loot and is omitted\nfrom the multiworld location pool.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Inclure les pick-ups du cimetière comme emplacements d'archipel.\n\nLorsque désactivé, ce donjon optionnel conserve le butin vanille et est omis de la piscine multimonde."},{"key":"include_castle_of_dreams","name":"Include Castle of Dreams","kind":"toggle","doc":"Include Castle of Dreams chest pickups as Archipelago locations.\n\nWhen disabled, that optional dungeon keeps vanilla loot and is omitted\nfrom the multiworld location pool.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Inclure Château de Dreams pick-ups poitrine comme des emplacements d'archipel.\n\nLorsque désactivé, ce donjon optionnel conserve le butin vanille et est omis de la piscine multimonde."},{"key":"include_tower_of_temptation","name":"Include Tower of Temptation","kind":"toggle","doc":"Include Tower of Temptation chest pickups as Archipelago locations.\n\nWhen disabled, that optional dungeon keeps vanilla loot and is omitted\nfrom the multiworld location pool.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Inclure Tower of Temptation pick-ups thorax comme des emplacements d'archipel.\n\nLorsque désactivé, ce donjon optionnel conserve le butin vanille et est omis de la piscine multimonde."},{"key":"magic_xp_multiplier","name":"Magic XP Multiplier","kind":"range","doc":"Multiply magic XP gained in battle (Fire/Wind/Water/Earth).\n\n1 is vanilla. Applies when a character earns magic XP from casting.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":10,"default":1,"doc_fr":"Multiplier la magie XP acquise dans la bataille (incendie/vent/eau/terre).\n\n1 est vanille. S'applique lorsqu'un personnage gagne la magie XP de casting."},{"key":"skill_xp_multiplier","name":"Skill XP Multiplier","kind":"range","doc":"Multiply weapon/skill XP gained in battle (Sword, Mace, Bow, etc.).\n\n1 is vanilla. Applies when a character earns weapon-skill XP from attacking.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":10,"default":1,"doc_fr":"Multipliez arme/tueur XP gagné dans la bataille (Épée, Mace, Bow, etc.).\n\n1 est vanille. S'applique lorsqu'un personnage gagne une arme à tuer XP en attaquant."},{"key":"level_xp_multiplier","name":"Level XP Multiplier","kind":"range","doc":"Multiply character level XP gained from battle.\n\n1 is vanilla. Applies to the EXP added to each party member after combat.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":10,"default":1,"doc_fr":"Multipliez le niveau de caractère XP gagné de la bataille.\n\n1 est vanille. S'applique à l'EXP ajouté à chaque membre du parti après le combat."},{"key":"gameplay_balance","name":"Gameplay Balance","kind":"choice","doc":"Grandia Remastered Redux gameplay tables (enemies, items, shops, names).\n\nVanilla uses stock HD Remaster data. Redux applies bundled content overlays\nat runtime (M_DAT enemies, WINDT prices/stats, shop stock, item names, etc.).\nRequires vanilla game files on disk — do not also install the Redux file pack.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"vanilla","label":"Vanilla","id":0},{"value":"redux","label":"Redux","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"vanilla","doc_fr":"Grandeia Remastered Redux gameplay tables (ennemis, articles, magasins, noms).\n\nVanilla utilise les données HD Remaster. Redux applique des superpositions de contenu groupées à l'exécution (ennemis M DAT, prix/stats WINDT, stock de magasin, noms d'articles, etc.).\nNécessite des fichiers de jeu de vanille sur le disque — n'installez pas aussi le pack de fichiers Redux."},{"key":"custom_party","name":"Custom Party","kind":"choice","doc":"How the battle/menu party is determined.\n\nvanilla: Stock story parties; no custom party overlay.\nroulette: A random 4-character roster is picked at generation and locked for\nthe whole seed; no custom party overlay.\nunlocks: Start with Justin only; other characters are Useful AP items. The\nSave menu Party tab edits the roster among unlocked members only.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"vanilla","label":"Vanilla","id":0},{"value":"roulette","label":"Roulette","id":1},{"value":"unlocks","label":"Unlocks","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"unlocks","doc_fr":"Comment le parti de la bataille/menu est déterminé.\n\nvanille: Fêtes d'histoires de stock; pas de superposition de fête personnalisée.\nroulette : Une liste aléatoire de 4 caractères est sélectionnée à la génération et verrouillée pour la graine entière; aucune superposition de partie personnalisée.\ndéverrouillages: Commencez avec Justin seulement; d'autres caractères sont des éléments AP utiles. L'onglet Enregistrer le menu Partie modifie la liste des membres déverrouillés seulement."}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"exclude_locations","name":"Excluded Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an important item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an important item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément important.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément important.</p>\n"},{"key":"priority_locations","name":"Priority Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément sans importance.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément sans importance.</p>\n"},{"key":"item_links","name":"Item Links","kind":"plando","doc":"Share part of your item pool with other players.","weighted":false,"visibility":13,"doc_html":"<p>Share part of your item pool with other play